  "title": "Solar Panels, Integrated Solutions Made in Europe | SoliTek",
  "content": "Toughest solar panels in the world\n3.2 + 3.2 mm double heat-strengthened glass makes SoliTek modules probably the thickest solar panels in the world.\nThis construction gives them exceptional strength and durability:\n- Resistant to 50 mm hail - the highest Hail Class 5 rating\n- Resistant to heavy snow loads up to 10,500 Pa - equal to around 10 meters of snow per 1 m²\n- Resistant to hurricane-speed winds up to 320 km/h - 5,400 Pa\nThanks to this extreme mechanical resistance, SoliTek panels come with a 30-year product warranty and are designed for a 50-year lifetime. After 30 years, we still guarantee 90% efficiency.",
